# into the programs are the same on every system.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ogg binary
*.opus binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
